<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cable &amp; Wireless upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cable &amp; Wireless upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Cable and Wireless Plc was upgraded to near-term accumulate from neutral, and to long-term buy from accumulate.</p>
</text>
